@startuml sale_state_uml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

title Life of a sale (Transaction)

[*] --> Active : seller accepts an offer\n(listing reserved)

state Active {
  [*] --> NoConfirmation
  NoConfirmation --> OneConfirmed : a participant confirms completion
  OneConfirmed --> CancellationPending : a participant requests cancellation
  CancellationPending --> OneConfirmed : other participant rejects,\nor requester withdraws
}

OneConfirmed --> Completed : the other participant confirms\n(listing sold, meetup completed)
NoConfirmation --> Cancelled : either participant cancels\n(listing available again)
CancellationPending --> Cancelled : other participant accepts\n(listing available again)

Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of CancellationPending
  Confirmations are blocked while
  a request is pending.
end note
note bottom of Cancelled
  Cancelling also cancels the sale's meetup
  and deletes its unbooked offered times.
end note
@enduml
